#, c-format
msgid "There was an error creating the folder “%s”."
msgstr "“%s” ᱨᱮᱫᱽ ᱵᱮᱱᱟᱣ ᱨᱮ ᱦᱩᱰᱟᱹᱜ ᱛᱟᱦᱮᱸ ᱠᱟᱱᱟ᱾"

#: src/nautilus-file-operations.c:4216
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Files in the folder “%s” cannot be copied because you do not have "
"permissions to see them."
msgstr ""
"ᱯᱚᱴᱚᱢ ᱨᱮ ᱢᱮᱱᱟᱜ ᱨᱮᱫᱽ ᱠᱚ “%s” ᱵᱟᱝ ᱠᱚᱯᱤ ᱫᱟᱲᱮᱭᱟᱜᱼᱟ ᱪᱮᱫᱟᱜ ᱥᱮ ᱟᱢ ᱴᱷᱮᱱ ᱚᱱᱟ ᱠᱚ ᱧᱮᱞ "
"ᱨᱮᱭᱟᱜ ᱟᱹᱭᱫᱟᱹᱨ ᱵᱟᱹᱱᱩᱜᱼᱟ᱾"

#: src/nautilus-file-operations.c:4290
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The folder “%s” cannot be copied because you do not have permissions to read "
